<title>UK: Moss Bros H1 pretax profits up 54 percent.</title>
<headline>Moss Bros H1 pretax profits up 54 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending July 27</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		18.34		  vs 12.83</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.50		   vs 5.00</p>
<p> Pretax		     4.94		   vs 3.21</p>
<p> Turnover		   48.53		  vs 36.07</p>
<p> Operating result	 4.33		   vs 2.70</p>
<p> Interest		   0.61 receivable    vs 0.51 receivable</p>
<p> Tax			  1.78		   vs 1.08</p>
<p> Net taxed		  3.16		   vs 2.15</p>
<p> Pay date		   November 12</p>
<p> Div registration date  October 22</p>
<p> Ex-div date		October 14</p>
<p>Note - Moss Bros Group Plc is a menswear retail chain.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
